        "content": "<p>adamrk opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15145\">PR #15145</a> from <code>adamrk:abk/elide-reader-typecheck-followup</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>When a <code>StreamReader&lt;T&gt;</code> or <code>FutureReader&lt;T&gt;</code> is lowered into a guest, <code>typecheck_lowered_transmit</code> checks the transmit's origin against the destination payload type. The type <code>T</code> has already been checked against the payload type, so this change allows the dynamic check to be elided in the cases when we can rely on the static check that was already done.</p>\n<p>There are 3 cases to consider:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>A <code>StreamReader&lt;T&gt;</code> was directly created in the host by a <code>Producer</code> with <code>P::Item == T</code>. This case is marked with a bool tag in the <code>HostResourceIndex</code> and no further checks are needed.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>A <code>StreamReader&lt;T&gt;</code> was created by the host, but has been passed through a guest and may have had its type loosened (e.g. a <code>StreamReader&lt;StreamReader&lt;String&gt;&gt;</code> became a <code>StreamReader&lt;StreamAny&gt;</code>). In this case, we compare the <code>TypeId</code> of the Producer's <code>P::Item</code> against <code>T</code> and skip further checks if they match. If they don't match we dynamically run the Producer's <code>typecheck</code>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>A <code>StreamAny</code> always runs the dynamic typecheck.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>This shows a ~5% improvement in the <code>p3_http_proxy</code> benchmark:</p>\n<p>Main (8c11e2e0edbd344886b6daab87aba5eb3a6e5ca9):</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">wasi</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">http</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">p3_http_proxy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">time</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">17.731</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">µ</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">17.751</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">µ</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">17.780</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">µ</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Found</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outliers</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">among</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">measurements</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">5.00</span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">1.00</span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">high</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mild</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">4.00</span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">high</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">severe</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">wasi</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">http</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">p3</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">api</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">request</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">new</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                        </span><span class=\"n\">time</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">1.4515</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">µ</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1.4536</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">µ</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1.4561</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">µ</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Found</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outliers</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">among</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">measurements</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">2.00</span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">1.00</span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">high</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mild</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">1.00</span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">high</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">severe</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">wasi</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">http</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">p3</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">api</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">response</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">consume</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">body</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                        </span><span class=\"n\">time</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mf